====Related terms====
*[[bioluminescent]]: A process converting biochemical energy to visible light (ie: firefly).
*[[chemoluminesce]]: A process converting chemical energy to visible light (ie:phosphorescence).
*[[electroluminesce]]: A process converting electrical energy to visible light (ie: light bulb).
*[[mechanoluminesce]]: A process converting mechanical energy to visible light (ie: hammer forge).
*[[photoluminesce]]: A process converting non-visible radiation to visible light (ie: 'black light' poster).
*[[piezoelectric]]: A process converting mechanical energy to voltage (ie: Radio crystal).
*[[piezoluminesce]]: A process converting mechanical energy to visible light (ie: wintergreen lifesaver candy).
*[[thermoluminesce]]: A process converting heat energy to visible light (ie: glass blower's oven).
